[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5293518497","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122382#issuecomment-5293518497","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122382","id":5293518497,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO4SuoQ","user":{"login":"PateevK","id":171885206,"node_id":"U_kgDOCj7Clg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171885206?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK","html_url":"https://github.com/PateevK","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T12:54:48Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T12:54:48Z","body":"can confirm. master eb491cb578(latest). Windows 11. With any rendering driver and method except opengl.\n\ndarker themes look better with hdr but the lighter ones become less readable. \n\n@clayjohn  So the solution would be just to not apply hdr to UI ?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5293518497/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5297018096","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122382#issuecomment-5297018096","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122382","id":5297018096,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO7oU8A","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T18:52:54Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T18:52:54Z","body":"> [@clayjohn](https://github.com/clayjohn) So the solution would be just to not apply hdr to UI ?\n\nSimply not applying HDR to the UI has some implications that I mentioned in [this comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/80868#issuecomment-4959686272).\n\nThe root cause is that transparency was implemented in the editor themes under the assumption it would always be applied to nonlinear sRGB-encoded colours. The solution might be to reduce/remove the need for transparency in these sorts of cases throughout the editor. Or maybe the editor can be modified to use different transparency values in its theme based on whether HDR 2D is enabled or not and/or based on the theme that's used.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5297018096/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]